# Configuración bastionada de OpenSSH (/etc/ssh/sshd_config.d/99-hardening.conf)
# Servidor objetivo: Ubuntu 22.04.5 LTS (admin-ddbb) - Lab 01

Port 2222
PermitRootLogin no
AllowUsers sysadmin
PasswordAuthentication no
PermitEmptyPasswords no
PubkeyAuthentication yes
MaxAuthTries 3
X11Forwarding no
